1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,540
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,541 --> 00:00:03,000
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,541 --> 00:00:06,250
(Episode 63)

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,905
He can't remember the past few years.

5
00:00:09,625 --> 00:00:12,656
Memories often return naturally over time,

6
00:00:12,928 --> 00:00:14,666
but sometimes they don't.

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,500
Ji Ni.

8
00:00:27,472 --> 00:00:29,058
Have you been praying this whole time?

9
00:00:29,416 --> 00:00:33,625
Well, I wouldn't be able to focus
on anything at home anyway.

10
00:00:34,625 --> 00:00:36,351
Why are you in such a hurry?

11
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:39,026
Did something happen to Ji Hu?

12
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:42,250
What's wrong? Please tell me.

13
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:46,000
I heard Ji Hu has woken up.

14
00:00:46,625 --> 00:00:47,791
Really?

15
00:00:48,916 --> 00:00:50,250
Wait.

16
00:00:50,916 --> 00:00:52,125
Why?

17
00:00:53,375 --> 00:00:58,625
He's awake, but they say
he doesn't recognize Yeong Ju.

18
00:00:59,875 --> 00:01:01,000
What?

19
00:01:02,899 --> 00:01:05,375
So when did I get back to Korea?

20
00:01:06,125 --> 00:01:09,032
It's been a few months.
Can you remember your time in England?

21
00:01:09,750 --> 00:01:11,375
You and mom came to see me.

22
00:01:12,559 --> 00:01:15,749
We spent time with Do Hee
and attended an end-of-year embassy party.

23
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:18,125
That's right.
You remember everything from then.

24
00:01:20,125 --> 00:01:23,391
Do Hee and I agreed to marry
once I came back to Korea.

25
00:01:23,392 --> 00:01:24,811
Did we already get married?

26
00:01:26,125 --> 00:01:27,547
No, that didn't happen.

27
00:01:27,633 --> 00:01:30,615
Don't worry about her. You two broke up.

28
00:01:30,625 --> 00:01:32,368
We broke up? Why?

29
00:01:32,750 --> 00:01:36,802
Why? That bitch Do Do Hee
is the reason you're in this state.

30
00:01:37,242 --> 00:01:39,326
- Dad.
- Do Hee hit you with her car.

31
00:01:39,375 --> 00:01:43,416
She's being questioned.
I've filed a complaint on your behalf.

32
00:01:44,473 --> 00:01:47,432
You're saying Do Hee hit me with a car?

33
00:01:48,291 --> 00:01:49,291
No way...

34
00:01:49,375 --> 00:01:52,250
Take this chance to end it.
Find someone better.

35
00:01:52,537 --> 00:01:54,662
But I started dating her
because you liked her, Mom.

36
00:01:55,307 --> 00:01:57,557
You said it was the best thing
I'd ever done.

37
00:01:57,787 --> 00:02:01,787
Anyway, that was then.

38
00:02:02,125 --> 00:02:03,582
She hit you with her car.

39
00:02:03,583 --> 00:02:05,888
No matter how badly you fought,
how could she do that?

40
00:02:07,153 --> 00:02:10,069
You really don't remember anything?

41
00:02:15,375 --> 00:02:18,250
Ji Hu, think about it later.

42
00:02:19,566 --> 00:02:22,066
I want to see Do Hee.
Please bring her here.

43
00:02:34,691 --> 00:02:39,441
Ma'am, what do you mean
Ji Hu has memory problems?

44
00:02:40,778 --> 00:02:44,278
She insisted on coming,
even though I told her not to.

45
00:02:45,625 --> 00:02:49,125
He can't recognize me.
His recent memories are gone.

46
00:02:51,250 --> 00:02:53,791
Even me...?

47
00:02:53,875 --> 00:02:54,979
I think so.

48
00:02:54,980 --> 00:02:57,313
I was afraid you'd be hurt,
so I told you not to come.

49
00:02:58,508 --> 00:03:00,042
That can't be.

50
00:03:37,569 --> 00:03:38,821
Why are you here?

51
00:03:38,994 --> 00:03:41,547
Leave! Don't come here!

52
00:03:49,066 --> 00:03:50,857
I told you not to come.

53
00:03:53,625 --> 00:03:55,405
I'll call you later.

54
00:04:17,375 --> 00:04:18,541
What happened?

55
00:04:19,646 --> 00:04:20,855
Well...

56
00:04:27,788 --> 00:04:29,636
Ji Hu woke up.

57
00:04:31,066 --> 00:04:33,485
But he doesn't remember me.
He doesn't know who I am.

58
00:04:34,256 --> 00:04:38,691
Memory loss? Does that really happen?

59
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:41,875
I can't believe it myself.
I wish I were dreaming.

60
00:04:42,701 --> 00:04:44,892
I'm so stunned I can't even cry.

61
00:04:45,664 --> 00:04:49,623
Jung A, how can this be happening?

62
00:04:49,682 --> 00:04:53,057
Are you sure?
Could that woman be lying to you?

63
00:04:53,656 --> 00:04:55,402
No, I saw him.

64
00:04:55,499 --> 00:04:59,490
Our eyes met on his way to get tested.
He looked at me like I was a stranger.

65
00:05:01,491 --> 00:05:02,929
I was so shocked...

66
00:05:03,625 --> 00:05:05,541
He doesn't recognize Yeong Ju either.

67
00:05:09,307 --> 00:05:10,854
I'm devastated.

68
00:05:11,712 --> 00:05:14,185
I only prayed that he'd wake up...

69
00:05:14,973 --> 00:05:18,932
Don't worry. Give him a few days.
I'm sure he'll remember.

70
00:05:19,604 --> 00:05:23,895
He was willing to die for you.
How could he forget you?

71
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:26,500
Unless they cut out his brain
during surgery...

72
00:05:28,125 --> 00:05:31,493
He'll remember soon, right?

73
00:05:31,790 --> 00:05:34,291
I should be grateful he's awake, right?

74
00:05:34,375 --> 00:05:37,541
Of course. That's a hundred times better
than him never waking up.

75
00:05:40,297 --> 00:05:43,511
He remembers Do Do Hee.
How does that make sense?

76
00:05:44,557 --> 00:05:49,557
He remembers Do Hee? This is insane.

77
00:05:50,288 --> 00:05:52,012
Maybe he wants to smack her.

78
00:05:52,271 --> 00:05:54,375
I guess he lost his memories,
but kept his anger.

79
00:06:03,306 --> 00:06:04,306
Yes, Mom.

80
00:06:05,219 --> 00:06:06,681
Ji Hu woke up?

81
00:06:07,375 --> 00:06:08,489
That's a relief.

82
00:06:10,243 --> 00:06:11,243
What?

83
00:06:13,422 --> 00:06:15,172
So that really happens.

84
00:06:17,297 --> 00:06:20,422
Okay. Bye.

85
00:06:31,875 --> 00:06:36,648
Hey, Na Ji Ni. Have you lost your mind?

86
00:06:36,649 --> 00:06:38,961
Are you going to live at the hospital?

87
00:06:39,500 --> 00:06:42,933
It's not like that. I was with Jung A.

88
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,124
Really?

89
00:06:45,625 --> 00:06:47,125
Hey...

90
00:06:48,375 --> 00:06:50,541
Give her a break. She must be upset.

91
00:06:50,625 --> 00:06:53,452
We all have problems.
You think the rest of us are happy?

92
00:06:56,085 --> 00:06:58,460
What's wrong? Has something happened?

93
00:07:17,041 --> 00:07:19,000
(Jong No Police Station)

94
00:07:32,172 --> 00:07:33,712
Stop snoring.

95
00:07:36,249 --> 00:07:37,749
Who do you think you are?

96
00:07:37,848 --> 00:07:39,348
I said be quiet!

97
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,604
Do Do Hee.

98
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:43,749
I can't sleep with all this noise.

99
00:07:43,750 --> 00:07:46,631
Im Ji Hu is on the phone.
Please step outside to take the call.

100
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:50,376
Ji Hu? Did he wake up?

101
00:07:59,454 --> 00:08:02,663
Ji Hu, when did you wake up?

102
00:08:03,413 --> 00:08:06,913
I'm sorry. Please get me out of here.

103
00:08:07,250 --> 00:08:11,625
Do Hee, did we break up?
Did you really hit me with your car?

104
00:08:11,867 --> 00:08:15,242
What? No.

105
00:08:15,738 --> 00:08:19,404
Why would I hit you with my car?
I made a driving mistake.

106
00:08:19,752 --> 00:08:21,627
In England, the steering wheel's
on the right.

107
00:08:21,873 --> 00:08:26,623
We had a fight. I was angry,
and I turned the wrong way.

108
00:08:26,625 --> 00:08:28,625
Okay. Now I understand.

109
00:08:29,829 --> 00:08:32,663
Are you really mad at me?

110
00:08:33,348 --> 00:08:34,863
No, I'm not.

111
00:08:35,922 --> 00:08:37,644
But why did we fight?

112
00:08:37,826 --> 00:08:39,353
I don't remember anything.

113
00:08:39,354 --> 00:08:41,951
I don't even know when I got to Korea.
It's all a blur.

114
00:08:42,431 --> 00:08:43,931
Come tell me what happened.

115
00:08:44,713 --> 00:08:47,812
Okay. Of course.

116
00:08:48,776 --> 00:08:50,591
Here's what happened...

117
00:08:57,414 --> 00:09:02,664
The woman I tried to save
is my coworker at the publishing house?

118
00:09:02,742 --> 00:09:05,576
Right. There's nothing between you two.

119
00:09:06,104 --> 00:09:09,104
You kept her from getting hurt
to protect me.

120
00:09:09,655 --> 00:09:11,239
So I wouldn't cause an accident.

121
00:09:12,357 --> 00:09:16,691
Actually, I'd been drinking too.
I'm sorry, Ji Hu.

122
00:09:19,201 --> 00:09:20,992
Okay. Let's talk in person.

123
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:24,000
Okay, I'll come and explain everything.

124
00:09:24,787 --> 00:09:27,037
Please help your dad understand.

125
00:09:28,432 --> 00:09:32,184
He's really angry with me
because he's got it all wrong.

126
00:09:32,585 --> 00:09:35,881
I'm scared, Ji Hu. Bye.

127
00:09:39,992 --> 00:09:42,201
So he doesn't remember?

128
00:09:43,163 --> 00:09:44,288
Back inside. Now.

129
00:09:44,957 --> 00:09:46,123
Just one more call.

130
00:09:46,125 --> 00:09:48,000
- No.
- It's important.

131
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:51,067
I need to see my lawyer. Right now.

132
00:09:54,066 --> 00:09:55,190
You want to settle?

133
00:09:55,192 --> 00:09:59,055
I talked to Do Hee.
I can't remember, but I'm fine.

134
00:09:59,057 --> 00:10:00,682
You call this fine?

135
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,189
Do you know how long you were unconscious?

136
00:10:03,576 --> 00:10:05,576
We were worried sick.

137
00:10:05,788 --> 00:10:08,379
Do Hee pretended to be sick
to avoid questioning.

138
00:10:09,495 --> 00:10:11,270
We barely managed to get her questioned.

139
00:10:11,672 --> 00:10:12,922
I'll never forgive her.

140
00:10:13,414 --> 00:10:14,414
But you liked Do Hee.

141
00:10:14,416 --> 00:10:16,874
I didn't know
she was that kind of person back then.

142
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:18,927
There's no rush.

143
00:10:19,094 --> 00:10:21,194
You can recover first and take your time.

144
00:10:21,250 --> 00:10:22,499
I want to see her now.

145
00:10:23,250 --> 00:10:25,967
It was so hard
when I couldn't play the piano anymore.

146
00:10:25,968 --> 00:10:27,416
Do Hee helped me a lot.

147
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:28,541
I know.

148
00:10:29,307 --> 00:10:30,603
You don't understand, Mom.

149
00:10:31,374 --> 00:10:34,613
You were only upset
that I couldn't get into Juilliard.

150
00:10:38,653 --> 00:10:40,569
I'm going home to rest for a while.

151
00:10:41,701 --> 00:10:42,951
Okay, go ahead.

152
00:11:03,117 --> 00:11:05,261
Ji Hu, how are you feeling today?

153
00:11:05,815 --> 00:11:07,326
I brought you lunch.

154
00:11:07,826 --> 00:11:09,960
But who are you?
You keep bringing me lunch.

155
00:11:11,364 --> 00:11:15,145
I'm your aunt. I married your uncle.

156
00:11:18,713 --> 00:11:19,797
Look.

157
00:11:23,047 --> 00:11:25,110
I see.

158
00:11:28,613 --> 00:11:29,968
Who is she, though?

159
00:11:30,694 --> 00:11:34,028
Don't you remember?
She's a friend you were close to.

160
00:11:34,125 --> 00:11:35,166
A friend of mine?

161
00:11:42,307 --> 00:11:43,932
What's wrong? Does it hurt?

162
00:11:46,248 --> 00:11:48,289
No. Show me a little more.

163
00:11:48,682 --> 00:11:49,682
Okay.

164
00:11:53,710 --> 00:11:55,126
It's Tae O.

165
00:11:55,367 --> 00:11:57,617
That's right. You remember him.

166
00:11:58,332 --> 00:11:59,695
He's a childhood friend.

167
00:12:00,011 --> 00:12:02,498
I even tried calling him,
but he didn't answer.

168
00:12:02,547 --> 00:12:03,588
I see.

169
00:12:06,625 --> 00:12:08,207
Sa Bin looks happy.

170
00:12:08,913 --> 00:12:12,174
You and this friend...

171
00:12:13,661 --> 00:12:15,413
helped him propose.

172
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,125
I did?

173
00:12:23,153 --> 00:12:25,403
Yes, Father.

174
00:12:27,451 --> 00:12:28,676
Yes, I'm fine.

175
00:12:30,566 --> 00:12:33,566
I didn't know Ji Hu resented me like that.

176
00:12:35,241 --> 00:12:37,991
He thought I was only upset
about him not getting into Juilliard.

177
00:12:41,047 --> 00:12:42,922
His memory isn't fully back yet.

178
00:12:43,765 --> 00:12:46,060
It's coming back bit by bit.
Let's give him time.

179
00:12:46,085 --> 00:12:49,585
But he remembers Do Hee
and doesn't recognize Ji Ni.

180
00:12:50,666 --> 00:12:53,466
No matter how I look at it,
I prefer Do Hee to Ji Ni.

181
00:12:53,896 --> 00:12:55,123
What about you?

182
00:12:55,125 --> 00:12:56,721
Are those the only two women in the world?

183
00:12:57,256 --> 00:12:59,000
Once his memory comes back,
find him someone else.

184
00:12:59,041 --> 00:13:01,371
You know how Ji Hu is.

185
00:13:01,620 --> 00:13:03,306
He only looks for Do Hee.

186
00:13:03,807 --> 00:13:06,973
Once his memory comes back,
he'll look for Ji Ni.

187
00:13:07,066 --> 00:13:09,857
He cared about her enough to die for her.
Do you think he'll give up on her?

188
00:13:10,076 --> 00:13:13,951
I'd rather have Do Hee.
We can just send them to England.

189
00:13:18,067 --> 00:13:22,817
She wasn't trying to hit Ji Hu.

190
00:13:23,469 --> 00:13:25,677
She was actually trying to hit Ji Ni.

191
00:13:27,134 --> 00:13:29,371
It's not entirely unreasonable.

192
00:13:36,586 --> 00:13:37,586
Hello?

193
00:13:37,588 --> 00:13:40,422
Congratulations. Ji Hu's awake.

194
00:13:40,473 --> 00:13:42,211
It's too soon to celebrate.

195
00:13:42,213 --> 00:13:44,514
My future son-in-law
was desperately asking for Do Hee.

196
00:13:46,771 --> 00:13:50,355
We've filed for a detention review,
so she'll be released soon.

197
00:13:50,538 --> 00:13:52,414
Let those two see each other.

198
00:13:53,750 --> 00:13:57,166
General, if they clear things up
and get back together,

199
00:13:57,528 --> 00:14:01,318
I'll do everything I can
to secure Ji Hu's future.

200
00:14:02,710 --> 00:14:06,960
Please be understanding of my daughter.
She's immature and hot-tempered.

201
00:14:07,501 --> 00:14:08,585
Okay.

202
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,507
I'll be in touch.

203
00:14:18,163 --> 00:14:19,204
Ambassador Do?

204
00:14:21,348 --> 00:14:24,307
He must be desperate
with his daughter in a holding cell.

205
00:14:24,895 --> 00:14:26,479
Looks like he spoke to Ji Hu.

206
00:14:27,582 --> 00:14:29,873
He promised more support
if they end up together.

207
00:14:29,875 --> 00:14:30,875
See?

208
00:14:31,250 --> 00:14:35,914
She's a hundred times better than Ji Ni,
who has no dad and only her nasty mom.

209
00:14:36,691 --> 00:14:39,816
She's just got a bad temper.

210
00:14:40,011 --> 00:14:42,989
She's straightforward and simple.
She doesn't scheme.

211
00:14:49,913 --> 00:14:51,844
My cousin called me.

212
00:14:51,845 --> 00:14:55,234
She checked Do Hee's case number
and found it had been closed.

213
00:14:55,632 --> 00:14:57,923
They ruled it negligent driving.
Can you believe that?

214
00:14:58,500 --> 00:15:02,000
Now I know how it feels
to be so angry you could explode.

215
00:15:04,153 --> 00:15:07,819
Where are you going?

216
00:15:07,998 --> 00:15:08,998
Don't stop me.

217
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,541
- Na Ji Ni!
- Enough!

218
00:15:11,241 --> 00:15:13,873
Do Hee's about to get away with it again.

219
00:15:13,876 --> 00:15:15,074
This isn't right.

220
00:15:15,250 --> 00:15:16,914
I have to see Ji Hu.

221
00:15:16,916 --> 00:15:19,792
Just because he can't remember
doesn't make this okay!

222
00:15:20,213 --> 00:15:24,213
Ji Ni, I understand how you feel.
I'm angry too.

223
00:15:24,306 --> 00:15:28,181
But that's for his family to decide.
You have no say in it.

224
00:15:28,375 --> 00:15:32,666
Besides, he doesn't even remember you.
Let it go.

225
00:15:32,750 --> 00:15:34,573
No! This can't be happening.

226
00:15:35,347 --> 00:15:38,806
Besides, maybe if he sees me...

227
00:15:39,250 --> 00:15:41,500
If he really looks at me again,
he might remember me.

228
00:15:41,541 --> 00:15:45,591
Yeong Ju showed him your picture.
He didn't react at all.

229
00:15:45,625 --> 00:15:49,000
He doesn't even know his own age.
How could he remember you?

230
00:15:49,955 --> 00:15:53,520
So I'm just supposed to sit back
and do nothing...

231
00:15:54,118 --> 00:15:56,039
when I'm going crazy like this?

232
00:15:56,041 --> 00:15:59,125
What else can you do?
He doesn't remember you.

233
00:16:00,807 --> 00:16:05,765
Ji Ni, let's forget
about both Ji Hu and Do Hee.

234
00:16:05,941 --> 00:16:10,982
If you stay away from Ji Hu,
Do Hee won't bother you anymore.

235
00:16:11,875 --> 00:16:15,001
No! I'm not afraid of her.

236
00:16:15,469 --> 00:16:17,661
You want me to keep avoiding someone
who tried to kill me?

237
00:16:17,750 --> 00:16:20,577
Ji Hu risked his life for me.

238
00:16:20,941 --> 00:16:22,587
I'll protect him too.

239
00:16:22,625 --> 00:16:27,250
I'll make him remember
and make Do Hee pay for what she did.

240
00:16:27,875 --> 00:16:30,250
Ji Ni!

241
00:16:49,876 --> 00:16:51,751
Ji Hu!

242
00:16:52,375 --> 00:16:55,875
- Do Hee.
- Ji Hu!

243
00:16:56,539 --> 00:16:57,664
I missed you.

244
00:16:57,703 --> 00:16:59,828
I missed you too.

245
00:17:01,817 --> 00:17:05,179
Do Hee,
Ji Hu has only just started recovering.

246
00:17:05,418 --> 00:17:06,817
Be a little more careful.

247
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:09,810
Mother, I promise I'll do better.

248
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:13,750
I'll control my temper, treat him well,
and be good to you too.

249
00:17:13,867 --> 00:17:16,576
Okay. Let's hope so.

250
00:17:16,894 --> 00:17:21,685
Mother, I was so lonely
at the police station.

251
00:17:22,047 --> 00:17:25,297
I thought my world had ended.
You know I prayed all night?

252
00:17:25,666 --> 00:17:27,804
I prayed for him to wake up.

253
00:17:27,805 --> 00:17:31,791
I realized I had to truly repent
and become a better person.

254
00:17:32,066 --> 00:17:33,566
And now I've been blessed like this.

255
00:17:34,944 --> 00:17:36,778
Like she's the one who prayed. Honestly...

256
00:17:37,922 --> 00:17:38,963
What?

257
00:17:39,750 --> 00:17:40,968
Never mind.

258
00:17:41,625 --> 00:17:45,250
I'll be good to you too, Aunt.
Please give me another chance.

259
00:17:46,250 --> 00:17:48,367
- I'm doing great, right?
- You always do.

260
00:17:49,875 --> 00:17:51,310
What's the earliest thing you remember?

261
00:17:51,311 --> 00:17:54,157
Tell me everything. I'll fill you in.

262
00:17:59,242 --> 00:18:02,451
You really don't remember anything?
It's okay. It'll come back.

263
00:18:03,172 --> 00:18:05,422
I'll help you remember everything, okay?

264
00:18:07,654 --> 00:18:09,021
That little bastard.

265
00:18:10,319 --> 00:18:14,028
If only he'd let Do Hee run Ji Ni over.

266
00:18:14,875 --> 00:18:18,399
One in prison, the other dead.
Wouldn't that have been perfect?

267
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:21,541
What a mess! Seriously!

268
00:18:26,586 --> 00:18:28,002
That little brat!

269
00:18:31,358 --> 00:18:32,905
I told you not to come here.

270
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:35,315
Didn't I tell you you're bad luck?

271
00:18:35,806 --> 00:18:37,306
Don't you listen to your elders?

272
00:18:37,576 --> 00:18:40,742
- Why do you keep hitting her like this?
- Stay out of this.

273
00:18:40,791 --> 00:18:43,250
I'm going to mess this brat up today.

274
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:47,306
Ma'am, let me see Ji Hu.

275
00:18:47,307 --> 00:18:48,982
There's something important
I have to tell him.

276
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:50,354
Ji Ni.

277
00:18:59,607 --> 00:19:02,194
You shouldn't be hitting me right now.
You should be hitting Do Do Hee.

278
00:19:02,195 --> 00:19:03,287
Am I wrong?

279
00:19:03,289 --> 00:19:06,664
What did I do wrong?
Ji Hu and I are the victims here.

280
00:19:06,684 --> 00:19:09,018
You're the reason
all of this happened in the first place.

281
00:19:09,836 --> 00:19:12,028
I told you to stay away from my son.

282
00:19:12,778 --> 00:19:15,028
So you had Do Do Hee released
because of me?

283
00:19:15,873 --> 00:19:17,873
Since he's lost his memory
and doesn't know anything,

284
00:19:18,007 --> 00:19:20,248
you want him to go ahead
and marry Do Do Hee as planned?

285
00:19:20,278 --> 00:19:22,840
- Because you don't want Ji Hu to love me?
- That's right.

286
00:19:23,047 --> 00:19:24,877
She's better than you,
the daughter of a mistress.

287
00:19:25,229 --> 00:19:27,354
What can you possibly offer Ji Hu?

288
00:19:27,491 --> 00:19:30,423
At least Do Hee has a powerful father.

289
00:19:30,853 --> 00:19:33,200
Know your place before you challenge me.

290
00:19:39,028 --> 00:19:41,634
Ji Ni, later...

291
00:19:46,075 --> 00:19:47,950
Ji Hu, it's me. Na Ji Ni.

292
00:19:50,742 --> 00:19:53,576
You really don't know who I am?

293
00:19:55,838 --> 00:19:57,466
You even gave me this necklace.

294
00:19:58,250 --> 00:19:59,291
I did?

295
00:20:04,116 --> 00:20:05,241
Get out of here. Now!

296
00:20:05,528 --> 00:20:06,944
You leave!

297
00:20:08,750 --> 00:20:10,000
Why are you acting like this?

298
00:20:10,791 --> 00:20:14,058
Ji Hu, be careful of this woman.

299
00:20:15,066 --> 00:20:17,112
She thinks you like her.

300
00:20:17,349 --> 00:20:18,941
It's because you were
a little too nice to her.

301
00:20:21,307 --> 00:20:23,189
Please, try to remember.

302
00:20:23,864 --> 00:20:28,489
You called yourself the Little Mermaid.
Is this how you treat me, Ji Hu?

303
00:20:28,979 --> 00:20:30,037
The Little Mermaid?

304
00:20:30,537 --> 00:20:32,787
Hey, I said get out.

305
00:20:42,875 --> 00:20:45,375
Ji Ni.

306
00:20:49,778 --> 00:20:53,653
Ma'am, what am I going to do?

307
00:20:56,913 --> 00:20:58,204
It's okay.

308
00:21:15,875 --> 00:21:16,875
What are you doing here?

309
00:21:17,297 --> 00:21:20,672
Watch your tone. You're way too young
to talk to me like that.

310
00:21:22,144 --> 00:21:24,002
You're not even intimidated
by all these people watching.

311
00:21:24,299 --> 00:21:25,404
Why are you here?

312
00:21:25,787 --> 00:21:28,412
If you're here to see the General,
you're in for a fight.

313
00:21:29,662 --> 00:21:30,924
You know my temper.

314
00:21:31,196 --> 00:21:34,916
Even if you begged me to meet him,
I wouldn't. I'm here to find my daughter.

315
00:21:37,166 --> 00:21:38,166
Daughter?

316
00:21:41,116 --> 00:21:42,857
Ji Hu, look at this.

317
00:21:43,602 --> 00:21:46,039
We had a good time that day, didn't we?
We had some good food too.

318
00:21:46,666 --> 00:21:47,972
Right? You remember, don't you?

319
00:21:49,125 --> 00:21:51,277
What about this day?
Do you remember this one too?

320
00:21:52,104 --> 00:21:56,270
Ji Hu, what are you doing?
Aren't you looking at the pictures?

321
00:21:57,014 --> 00:22:00,289
Wait, I felt like
I was about to remember something.

322
00:22:00,291 --> 00:22:04,291
Why are you trying to remember?
Don't think about it. Let's go for a walk.

323
00:22:07,556 --> 00:22:08,556
Let's go.

324
00:22:11,663 --> 00:22:12,704
Where are you going?

325
00:22:12,854 --> 00:22:14,976
We're going for a walk, Mother.

326
00:22:16,125 --> 00:22:17,250
Okay.

327
00:22:32,320 --> 00:22:34,779
You have a handprint on your face.

328
00:22:37,704 --> 00:22:40,027
You should let the swelling
on your face go down before going home.

329
00:22:44,449 --> 00:22:46,449
- Ji Ni!
- Mom.

330
00:22:48,594 --> 00:22:52,217
What happened to your face?
Did someone hit you?

331
00:22:52,450 --> 00:22:54,771
No. Why would anyone hit me?

332
00:22:55,047 --> 00:22:57,447
Yeong Ju, did you just stand there
and watch her get hit?

333
00:23:00,769 --> 00:23:03,935
Se Ri, we'll talk later.
Don't start arguing right now.

334
00:23:04,047 --> 00:23:05,047
Forget it.

335
00:23:09,500 --> 00:23:10,826
Try to stop her.

336
00:23:11,694 --> 00:23:14,278
Hey, you're Na Se Ri's daughter?

337
00:23:15,816 --> 00:23:18,066
How did this happen?

338
00:23:18,375 --> 00:23:21,625
Ask questions later.
Hurry up and go stop her!

339
00:23:21,916 --> 00:23:25,541
What am I supposed to...

340
00:23:34,713 --> 00:23:37,821
Why did you hit her?
Why would you hit my daughter?

341
00:23:37,992 --> 00:23:40,867
Did we tell Ji Hu to get in the way
of Do Hee's car?

342
00:23:40,884 --> 00:23:43,134
Did we push Ji Hu into its path?

343
00:23:43,166 --> 00:23:47,000
- You little...
- Your child matters, and so does mine.

344
00:23:47,041 --> 00:23:48,750
Who do you think you are, hitting her?

345
00:23:49,125 --> 00:23:53,041
She blames herself for Ji Hu's accident
and has been praying day and night.

346
00:23:53,166 --> 00:23:56,000
Who are you to hit her?
What gives you the right?

347
00:23:57,875 --> 00:23:58,916
Se Ri.

348
00:23:59,441 --> 00:24:01,191
Don't bother calling me Se Ri.

349
00:24:01,375 --> 00:24:03,207
I came to pick up Ji Ni,

350
00:24:03,208 --> 00:24:05,250
and when I saw a handprint
this big on her face,

351
00:24:05,365 --> 00:24:07,132
I came here to demand an explanation.

352
00:24:07,250 --> 00:24:09,791
Did I do something wrong?
Tell me, am I wrong?

353
00:24:10,500 --> 00:24:11,812
You hit her?

354
00:24:12,125 --> 00:24:15,046
- Yes, I did. She brings bad luck.
- You're the one who's bad luck!

355
00:24:15,125 --> 00:24:17,250
What kind of parent are you
that your son lost his memory?

356
00:24:17,291 --> 00:24:19,875
Maybe he doesn't want
to remember his own parents!

357
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:22,500
- Se Ri.
- Yes, that hurts to hear, doesn't it?

358
00:24:22,759 --> 00:24:25,533
Well, your unreasonable accusations
hurt me too.

359
00:24:25,835 --> 00:24:28,140
You keep calling me a mistress.

360
00:24:28,316 --> 00:24:31,191
If I really had an affair,
was it with your husband?

361
00:24:31,338 --> 00:24:35,713
That's right. Your husband
used to shower me with gifts.

362
00:24:35,944 --> 00:24:38,403
I picked out that dress
for you, by the way.

363
00:24:39,941 --> 00:24:42,107
You shouldn't bring that up like this.

364
00:24:42,895 --> 00:24:46,229
- Mom, let's go. I'm sorry. Come on, Mom.
- Fine, let go of me.

365
00:24:50,951 --> 00:24:52,201
What now?

366
00:24:53,422 --> 00:24:54,547
Se Ri!

367
00:24:54,750 --> 00:24:56,500
That's for hitting my daughter.

368
00:24:56,931 --> 00:25:00,181
She's too precious.
Don't you dare mistreat her.

369
00:25:01,691 --> 00:25:05,482
Don't you ever come back here! Get out!

370
00:25:07,875 --> 00:25:09,337
That woman is crazy.

371
00:25:17,723 --> 00:25:20,473
Come on, get inside!

372
00:25:20,791 --> 00:25:23,250
Mom!

373
00:25:23,319 --> 00:25:24,819
Just try coming out!

374
00:25:24,875 --> 00:25:27,125
- I'll kill myself!
- Mom.

375
00:25:27,250 --> 00:25:29,593
Come out if you want to see me dead!

376
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:32,875
I don't even want to hear Ji Hu's name!
You mention him every chance you get!

377
00:25:34,875 --> 00:25:36,791
Mom.

378
00:25:37,000 --> 00:25:40,616
Hey, get me a padlock.
I'm going to lock this up.

379
00:25:40,617 --> 00:25:42,250
Don't you have a padlock?

380
00:25:42,291 --> 00:25:44,125
What's going on?
Did you just come from the hospital?

381
00:25:51,875 --> 00:25:55,500
I feel so wronged and furious
that I just...

382
00:25:56,500 --> 00:26:01,000
Honey, take me with you too.

383
00:26:02,020 --> 00:26:05,104
I'm so tired and worn out.

384
00:26:20,319 --> 00:26:22,527
I've thought it over, and we're done.

385
00:26:23,185 --> 00:26:24,269
Father.

386
00:26:25,250 --> 00:26:26,839
Stay away from Ji Hu.

387
00:26:27,662 --> 00:26:31,374
I'll make no decisions
until he regains his memory.

388
00:26:31,941 --> 00:26:37,232
I dropped the charges for old times' sake.
Let's end this here.

389
00:26:49,750 --> 00:26:54,500
(Na Ji Ni)

390
00:27:00,625 --> 00:27:01,829
Yes, Ji Hu.

391
00:27:03,144 --> 00:27:06,894
Of course we can meet. I'll come anytime.

392
00:27:07,797 --> 00:27:10,672
Okay.

393
00:27:19,375 --> 00:27:20,533
Ji Hu...

394
00:27:23,403 --> 00:27:25,278
Thank you, Ji Hu.

395
00:28:00,625 --> 00:28:03,874
(Family Register)

396
00:28:03,875 --> 00:28:06,498
Ji Hu is out of the question.
Not even if the world falls apart!

397
00:28:06,500 --> 00:28:08,089
Uncle, please help me.

398
00:28:08,090 --> 00:28:10,125
My love for him is 100 percent sincere.

399
00:28:10,166 --> 00:28:12,137
Hurry up and get Ji Hu married to Do Hee.

400
00:28:12,138 --> 00:28:13,666
Once they're married, she'll give up.

401
00:28:13,750 --> 00:28:17,416
I've finally decided to love you back.
I'm sorry it took me so long.

402
00:28:17,500 --> 00:28:19,499
It seems everyone is against us
being together.

403
00:28:19,500 --> 00:28:21,666
Don't come. I don't want us
to stay in touch anymore.

404
00:28:22,857 --> 00:28:24,857
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
